{%- comment -%}
  ca-sentry.liquid — browser error reporting to Sentry (project agency-site, org conspire-agency),
  added 2026-11-21 for a few weeks after the contact form's fallback went unnoticed (Danny: "just to
  make sure that there's no issues elsewhere on the site").

  Errors only: no tracing, no session replay, no user data (sendDefaultPii off), no cookies. Only
  errors thrown by our own code count: allowUrls keeps scripts served from conspireagency.com (theme
  assets and inline scripts), so browser extensions and third-party app scripts are dropped.
  Shopify serves its web pixel sandbox (app and custom pixels) from our domain under /web-pixels/;
  its worker fails to load when a visitor's blocker stops it, so anything naming /web-pixels/ is
  ignored too (AGENCY-SITE-2 and -3, 2026-11-21), as are Shopify's own pixel manager (/cdn/wpm/)
  and shop events listener, whose fetches fail the same way (AGENCY-SITE-4 and -8, 2026-11-22).
  A failed fetch has no stack frame of its own (or only the inline page's), so allowUrls cannot
  tell whose it is; the SDK does put the host in the message, "Load failed (alocdn.com)", so a
  failed fetch to any host that is not conspireagency.com or one of its subdomains is ignored.
  Those are app scripts' calls stopped by a visitor's tracking protection (AGENCY-SITE-B and -C,
  2026-11-27: the Opensend app embed's cookie sync to alocdn.com). Fetches to our own hosts,
  the contact form's to projects.conspireagency.com among them, still report. Off in
  the theme editor; a preview link reports as environment "preview". The Loader script loads the
  SDK only when the first error happens, so the page pays nothing until then. Async, so it never blocks the page; an error in the first moment before the Loader has run is not seen.

  To remove: delete this snippet and its render in layout/theme.liquid.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- unless request.design_mode -%}
  <script>
    window.sentryOnLoad = function () {
      Sentry.init({
        environment: /preview_theme_id|shopifypreview\.com|myshopify\.com/.test(location.href) ? 'preview' : 'production',
        allowUrls: [/^https?:\/\/(www\.)?conspireagency\.com\//],
        denyUrls: [/\/web-pixels\//, /\/cdn\/wpm\//, /\/shopifycloud\/storefront\/assets\/shop_events_listener/],
        ignoreErrors: ['ResizeObserver loop', 'Non-Error promise rejection captured', /^Script error\.?$/, /\/web-pixels\//,
          /(?:Failed to fetch|Load failed|NetworkError when attempting to fetch resource\.) \((?!(?:[a-z0-9-]+\.)*conspireagency\.com\))[^)]+\)$/i],
        sendDefaultPii: false,
        tracesSampleRate: 0,
        replaysSessionSampleRate: 0,
        replaysOnErrorSampleRate: 0,
        sampleRate: 1.0
      });
      Sentry.setTag('template', {{ template.name | json }});
    };
  </script>
  <script src="https://js.sentry-cdn.com/dc22aa4e28dbc913bbb525a3d1e63430.min.js" crossorigin="anonymous" async></script>
{%- endunless -%}
